{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once Up Musical</strong><br>Step into the fairytale world of <i>Once Up</i> and experience the unique soundtrack of a game that captivates from the very first moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <i>Once Up</i> soundtrack includes all 21 original songs from the game, as well as 3 additional bonus tracks that were not featured in the final version, yet played an important role in shaping the musical direction of the project. These pieces offer an exclusive look behind the scenes, showcasing music that didn\u2019t make the final cut but still carries its own emotional and creative weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm especially proud to have created this soundtrack with the help of AI tools that supported me in recording vocals, building choral arrangements, and bringing many other creative elements to life. I also wrote all the lyrics myself to reflect the story and atmosphere of the game. The final tracks were edited and refined in Audacity to match the tone of the game perfectly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This soundtrack is the perfect companion for anyone who wants to relive the magical experience of <i>Once Up</i> beyond the game. Get your copy now, including the exclusive bonus tracks, and immerse yourself in the musical world of this extraordinary story!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904910?t=1755017858","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904910?t=1755017858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904910/2664f9f74db6d5577bdc9576d9585bfff7f7fb47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755017858","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904910/2664f9f74db6d5577bdc9576d9585bfff7f7fb47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755017858","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once Up Musical</strong><br>Step into the fairytale world of <i>Once Up</i> and experience the unique soundtrack of a game that captivates from the very first moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <i>Once Up</i> soundtrack includes all 21 original songs from the game, as well as 3 additional bonus tracks that were not featured in the final version, yet played an important role in shaping the musical direction of the project. These pieces offer an exclusive look behind the scenes, showcasing music that didn\u2019t make the final cut but still carries its own emotional and creative weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm especially proud to have created this soundtrack with the help of AI tools that supported me in recording vocals, building choral arrangements, and bringing many other creative elements to life. I also wrote all the lyrics myself to reflect the story and atmosphere of the game. The final tracks were edited and refined in Audacity to match the tone of the game perfectly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This soundtrack is the perfect companion for anyone who wants to relive the magical experience of <i>Once Up</i> beyond the game. Get your copy now, including the exclusive bonus tracks, and immerse yourself in the musical world of this extraordinary story!</p>","developers":["Rennsemmel81","Sculptyfix"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3664510","name":"Once Up"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904910/717ead29332b1cb896b2e57101ffa2b7f6073048/header.jpg?t=1755017858","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Once Up Musical","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"c